entries[99152] = { ["name"] = "Chronomancer Robes", ["text"] = "Heroic\nBinds when picked up\nChest Cloth\n4 Armor\n+1 Intellect\n+7 Stamina\n+ 1 Critical Strike\n+ 2 Mastery\n\nPrismatic Socket\nPrismatic Socket\nPrismatic Socket\nSocket Bonus: + 7 Intellect\n\nDurability 165 / 165\nClasses: Mage\nChronomancer Regalia (0/5)\nChronomancer Robes\nChronomancer Mantle\nChronomancer Gloves\nChronomancer Hood\nChronomancer Leggings\nLegacy Set: Bonus is inactive\n(2) Set : Arcane Missiles causes your next Arcane Blast within 10 sec to cost 25% less mana, stacking up to 4 times. Consuming Brain Freeze increases the damage of your next Ice Lance, Frostbolt, Frostfire Bolt, or Cone of Cold by 20%. Consuming Pyroblast! increases your haste by 12 for 5 sec, stacking up to 5 times.\n(4) Set : Arcane Missiles has a 15% chance to not consume Arcane Missiles!. Consuming Brain Freeze has a 30% chance to drop an icy boulder on your target. Inferno Blast also causes your next Pyroblast to be a critical strike.\nSell Price:" }
