entries[99348] = { ["name"] = "Helmet of the Barbed Assassin", ["text"] = "Mythic\nBinds when picked up\nHead Leather\n6 Armor\n+1 [Agility or Intellect]\n+7 Stamina\n+ 1 Haste\n+ 2 Mastery\n\nMeta Socket\nPrismatic Socket\nSocket Bonus: + 7 Agility\n\nDurability 100 / 100\nClasses: Rogue\nBarbed Assassin Battlegear (0/5)\nGloves of the Barbed Assassin\nTunic of the Barbed Assassin\nHelmet of the Barbed Assassin\nLegguards of the Barbed Assassin\nSpaulders of the Barbed Assassin\nLegacy Set: Bonus is inactive\n(2) Set : When you generate a combo point from Revealing Strike's effect, Honor Among Thieves, or Seal Fate, your next combo point generating ability has its energy cost reduced by [ Backstab : 2 ] [ Blindside : 6 / 15 ]. Stacks up to 5 times.\n(4) Set : Killing Spree deals 10% more damage every time it strikes a target. Abilities against a target with Vendetta on it increase your mastery by 4 for 5 sec, stacking up to 20 times. Every time you Backstab, you have a 4% chance to replace your Backstab with Ambush that can be used regardless of Stealth.\nSell Price:" }
